      <VERS vnumber="2"> Out of <gr str="4480 6726">Zion</gr>, the <gr str="4359">perfection </gr>of <gr str="3308">beauty</gr>, <gr str="430">God </gr>hath <gr str="3313">shined</gr>. </VERS>
